  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua mikenshi ya Mose mikale ne mindidimbi ya bintu bimpe bilualua, kayi mikale tshifuanyikishi mene tshia bintu ebi, tshiendelele kayena mua kuvuisha badi basemena ba buibi ne Nzambi bakane tshishiki ne milambu ya muomumue ya ku tshidimu ku tshidimu, idibo bafila misangu yonso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bu milambu ai mibavuishe bakane tshishiki, kabakadi kulekela kuifila, anyi? Bualu bua batendeledi balengeshibue musangu umue kabakadi ne dimuma dia mibi kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi mu milambu yaya mudi tshivulukidi tshia mibi ku tshidimu ku tshidimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua mashi a ngombe ne a mbushi kêna mua kumusha mibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, halueye ba buloba, Kilisto udi wamba ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, bana betu, bualu bua tudi ne dikima dia kubuela mu muaba wa tshijila bua mashi a Yesu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu nshila wakatujidileye, nshila muhia-muhia ne wa muoyo, kuhita tshilulu tshikudika, kutshiamba ne, Mubidi wandi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne bualu bua tudi ne muakuidi mutambe ku mutu kua nsubu wa Nzambi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tusemene bietu ha buihi nʼandi ne mutshima mulelela mu dimanya dijalame dia ditabusha, ne mitshima yetu mimiamina bua kulengesha kua muoyo-mukese mubi, ne mibidi yetu miuvue ne mai mimpe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tulamate dijukula dia ditekemena dietu bua kaditshimbakanyi, bualu bua wakatuha mulayi udi wa kueyemenyibua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tudielelangane meshi muntu ne muntu bua kuenzeshangana ku dinanga ne ku dienza dia bienzedi bimpe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "katui tulekela bietu disangisha dietu bamue, bu mudi tshilele tshia bakuabo, kadi tukoleshangana mitshima, tutamba kuenza nunku bualu bua nudi numona dituku dia Mukelenge disemena ha buihi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua bituenza malu mabi bua disungula dia mutshima hatuakamana kuangata dimanya dia bushua, kakuena kushala kabidi munga mulambu bua kubuikidila nʼau mibi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kadi kudi kushala kuindila kukuabo kua dilumbulula kudi kukuatshisha buowa, ne kahia kakole nekoshe bahitshi bandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wakuhetula mikenshi ya Mose udi ufua, kai mufuidibue luse, ku dî dia bamanyi babidi anyi basatu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nudi nuela meshi ne muntu neabadibue muakanyine dikenga ditambe misangu bungi munyi, nyeye wakudiata Muana wa Nzambi munshi mua makasa andi, ne wakubala mashi a tshihungidi akadiye ujidibua nʼau bu tshintu tshia tshianana ne wakuhenda Nyuma wa ngasa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua tudi bamumanye yeye wakamba ne, Kusombuela mbualu buanyi, nempingishile bantu difutu diabo, wakamba kabidi ne, Mukelenge nealumbuluishe bantu bandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbualu bua buowa bua kuhona mu bianza bia Nzambi udi ne muoyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi nuvuluke matuku a diambedi munkatshi muau munuakatantamana mu diluangana dikole dia mu makenga, hanuakamana kutokeshibua mu munya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tshituha tshia makenga mbualu bua nuakavuishibua bu tshintu tshia kutangilatangilabo bua bihendu ne makenga; ne tshituha tshikuabo bualu bua nuakalua babanyanganyi ne bantu bakadi benjibua nunku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua nuakafuila bakadi mu lukanu luse, ne nuakitabusha ne disanka dihaula dia bintu bienu, bualu bua nudi bamanye ne, Tudi ne tshintu tshitamba buimpe ne tshidi tshishala tshiendelele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, kanuimashi dikima dienu, didi dinuhingishila difutu dinene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 10:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua nudi ne bualu bua kuikala ne didikankamika bua, hanuenza bu mu disua dia Nzambi, nudi mua kuangata mulayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.10.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.10.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
